# Editor and interpreter artefacts. None of this is course material, and everything in
# this repo is pulled into the website build -- a committed checkpoint file becomes a
# published file.
#
# ⚠️ Nothing here may match notebooks-dp/data/. Those CSVs and tests.py ARE the
# deliverable: the released notebooks fetch them from
# raw.githubusercontent.com/spcourse/pandas/main/notebooks-dp/data/ at run time, so a
# rule that quietly excluded them would break every notebook in students' hands.
# See DATA.md in the `solutions` repo (solutions/pandas/DATA.md).

# Jupyter autosaves, one per notebook or markdown file that has been opened.
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# JupyterLab writes these when the language server is active.
.virtual_documents/

# Left behind whenever a tests.py in this repo gets imported.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# macOS.
.DS_Store
